						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Saturday, November 20, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">CHANGE IN PLANS ! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Cause of our similar raid goals and wishes to pwn  many raid challenges per-night , Veterans of Solusek is now drafting 65+s into Echoes of Honor lead by Nurmall , VoS will remain a guild to continue letting lower lvls in, and then have them drafted into EoH ! Soo if any persons wish to join us in a fight for flags/xp/loot and Xtra PWNAGE SAUCE , plz contact Biko for VoS or get in touch with me for 65+ recruitment for EoH !
							<br><BR>
							 - Biko<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=585">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=585">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Saturday, November 13, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Knights of Nobility Inviting New Members </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Hail, Good Citizens of Norrath!<BR><BR>The Grand Duke and Grand Duchess of the Knights of Nobility cordially invite you to visit our earthly Fortress. Here, you can find out more about our organization, and determine if you are worthy of our ranks! At this time, we are reducing our level requirements to the 25th season in order to allow more opportunity for newcomers to enjoy what we have to offer.<BR><BR>Please click on the Guilds link on the left, then find Knights of Nobility in the list, and you will be directed to our Fortress. If you find that you have an interest in joining, please fill out our application and locate a Knight in Norrath.
							<br><BR>
							 - Tuwini<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=584">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, November 11, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">New Members </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Novus Satus is currently seeking new members. Please vist us at www.novussatus.com<BR><BR>Thanks<BR>Genalebe Layurhands<BR>Guild Leader of Novus Satus
							<br><BR>
							 - Genalebe<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=583">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Monday, November 08, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Legion of the White Rose - Passing of the Torch </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							I'd like to formally announce and acknowledge Lady Gentlewind as the new Guildmistress of the Legacy chapter of the Legion of the White Rose.  Lady Gentlewind has been a Legionnaire for over 2 years and has earned the respect and admiration of her Guildmates.  <BR><BR>This change comes in preparation for the founding of the Legion's Destiny chapter, set to be founded within the city of Qeynos in Everquest 2, where I shall remain as Guildmaster.<BR><BR>We wish our comrades in the old Norrath well, and know that they will do fine without our nightly contributions.  Both chapters will continue to follow the same standards of conduct that we've maintained during our six years of service.<BR><BR>Any who desire to join the Legacy chapter of the Legion are advised to contact Lady Gentlewind directly, or to visit their Guildhall at www.legion-whiterose.com .<BR><BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Kendricke<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=582">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=582">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, November 05, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">50 Shopping Days until CHRISTMAS! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Ahh just 50 shopping days until Christmas!
							<br><BR>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=580">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=580">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, November 04, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Guild Link update </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Can you please update the link for the guild Eternal Flames to http://eternalflames.meischke.de/eq<BR><BR>Thanks very much<BR><BR>Org
							<br><BR>
							 - Orgath<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=579">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=579">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

						<TR><TD><p class="pTitle">Eternal Flames Recruitment </p></TD></TR>
							<TR><TD><p class=pText>
							We are recruiting right now. We just passed Ikkinz 4 and are working on Uqua and MPG trials now. We are doing Time once a week, more Ikkinz and epics too. Prolly no Time backflagging anymore because of the upcoming changes to this system from SoE so that this isn't needed anymore.<BR><BR>Bards, Clerics, Druids, Echanters, Rogues, Tanks, Wizards preferred.<BR>Other applications will be considered though.<BR><BR>Read more about us and about our requirements here (the news need an update tho...hehe):<BR><BR><BR>http://eternalflames.meischke.de/eq/eq.php<BR><BR><BR>Tell Aturin, Nimmermer, Ristul or me in game.<BR><BR>So long<BR><BR>Org
							 <BR><BR>- Orgath<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=578">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp; <a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=578">[View Comments]</a>

					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
