							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Hail, Good Citizens of Norrath!<BR><BR>The Grand Duke and Grand Duchess of the Knights of Nobility cordially invite you to visit our earthly Fortress. Here, you can find out more about our organization, and determine if you are worthy of our ranks!  At this time, we are reducing our level requirements to the 25th season in order to allow more opportunity for newcomers to enjoy what we have to offer.<BR><BR>Please click on the Guilds link on the left, then find Knights of Nobility in the list, and you will be directed to our Fortress.  If you find that you have an interest in joining, please fill out our application and locate a Knight in Norrath.
							<br><BR>
							 - Tuwini<BR><BR>
							</p>
